#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:1
#: 341cbe96e29d4d2d94edd2f238e45fbe
msgid "Joystick teleop"
msgstr "手柄遥操作"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:3
#: 6851f8f07bc245f5a5c5c2e0c1a3cbda
msgid ""
"Use a game controller (joystick / gamepad) to command the arms and, in "
"chassis mode, the mobile base. The package is "
"[`arms_teleop`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md) in "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control). It"
" also contains a foot-pedal assist, which is not a complete teleop setup."
msgstr ""
"用游戏手柄（joystick / gamepad）控制手臂，在底盘模式下还可以控制移动底盘。软件包是 "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) 里的 "
"[`arms_teleop`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)。它还包含脚踏板辅助，那并不是完整的遥操作方案。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:5
#: f753df2abfb54a229497459f6c04237b
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:7
#: 34ca6d8f43c94ba6b67bed21660ecad1
msgid ""
"A robot stack is already running (mock, Isaac Sim, or real). This launch "
"does not start the controller."
msgstr "机器人运控已经在运行（mock、Isaac Sim 或真机）。这次启动不会拉起控制器。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:8
#: 105d41aaf0af4e04a739670fde76d2b3
msgid ""
"A game controller is connected. The default device is `/dev/input/js0`."
msgstr "已接入游戏手柄。默认设备是 `/dev/input/js0`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:10
#: b711acc6ae6145a99362b03f42ae7451
msgid "Start the joystick"
msgstr "启动手柄"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:12
#: 98e886ee9eef40f28d79a70fa1cb0ff0
msgid ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py"
msgstr ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:17
#: ce7d2a2be91a487983688b8fddffef82
msgid ""
"By default `joy_driver:=auto` uses `game_controller_node` when "
"`joy_enumerate_devices` reports the device as mapped, with "
"`generic_gamepad.yaml` (SDL standard layout). Unmapped devices fall back "
"to `joy_node` and `default.yaml`. The package README lists typical mapped "
"gamepads; do not treat that list as a compatibility guarantee for an "
"untested device."
msgstr ""
"默认 `joy_driver:=auto`：当 `joy_enumerate_devices` 把设备报告为已映射时，使用 "
"`game_controller_node`，配置为 `generic_gamepad.yaml`（SDL 标准布局）。未映射的设备会回退到 "
"`joy_node` 和 `default.yaml`。软件包 README 列出了常见的已映射手柄；不要把这份名单当成对未测试设备的兼容性保证。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 233436aa380a4098b93e40b6c1231e99
msgid ""
"Joystick control starts **disabled**. Press the **right stick** to enable "
"it, then move the sticks. Press the right stick again to disable."
msgstr "手柄控制默认是**关闭**的。按下**右摇杆**使能，再拨动摇杆。再按一次右摇杆则关闭。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:21
#: 393f8f36280549f29a84d829395c11b0
msgid "List connected devices:"
msgstr "列出已连接的设备："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:23
#: f9545e70fd004e17a549bce20e9bd0b2
msgid "ros2 run joy joy_enumerate_devices"
msgstr "ros2 run joy joy_enumerate_devices"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:27
#: bb69137240e342248af0acd29c8e1310
msgid ""
"If more than one controller is connected, pass the device you want, for "
"example `joy_dev:=/dev/input/js1`. Mapping overrides and keyboard teleop "
"are in the [package README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md). Do not run"
" `joystick_teleop` and `keyboard_teleop` at the same time if they would "
"publish to the same topics."
msgstr ""
"如果接了不止一个手柄，传入你要用的设备，例如 `joy_dev:=/dev/input/js1`。映射覆盖和键盘遥操作见 [软件包 "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)。如果 "
"`joystick_teleop` 和 `keyboard_teleop` 会往同一组话题发布，不要同时运行。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:29
#: 01dfa6532c6544898c34d311367f0fe6
msgid "What it publishes"
msgstr "它发布什么"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:31
#: c89663d28fa04ce08a81398c38d55830
msgid ""
"The joystick node publishes `control_input` "
"(`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`). "
"[arms_target_manager](../../4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md)"
" scales that message into `/left_target/twist` and `/right_target/twist`. "
"In chassis mode it publishes `/cmd_vel`. The joystick stack also publishes"
" `/fsm_command`."
msgstr ""
"手柄节点发布 "
"`control_input`（`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`）。[arms_target_manager](../../4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md)"
" 会把它换算成 `/left_target/twist` 和 `/right_target/twist`。在底盘模式下会发布 "
"`/cmd_vel`。手柄这一路还会发布 `/fsm_command`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:33
#: 53b54a01befb4641b18a9eb711172bdd
msgid "What you should see"
msgstr "预期看到的结果"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:35
#: 941dd1281aa54ddeb931182e6300fde9
msgid ""
"After you enable the controller, stick motion changes the active arm’s "
"target, or the chassis when you are in chassis mode. `teleop_mode` reports"
" whether the joystick is active."
msgstr "使能之后，拨动摇杆会改变当前手臂的目标；处于底盘模式时则控制底盘。`teleop_mode` 会报告手柄是否处于活动状态。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:39
#: 567a7ef317b04d689212fa3df02d72eb
msgid "Foot pedal (assist only)"
msgstr "脚踏板（仅作辅助）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:41
#: 1fc23d97e7cb4a318c57283be56f7c0b
msgid ""
"`foot_pedal_teleop` is an **assist**, not a standalone teleop path. It "
"reads one USB foot pedal (the packaged udev rule is for the SayoDevice "
"CM6K) and publishes events on `/teleop/controller_state`. It does **not** "
"publish `/fsm_command`. FSM transitions and teleop toggles are handled by "
"`VRInputHandler`."
msgstr ""
"`foot_pedal_teleop` 是**辅助输入**，不是独立的遥操作路径。它读取一块 USB 脚踏板（随包装的 udev 规则针对 "
"SayoDevice CM6K），并在 `/teleop/controller_state` 上发布事件。它**不会**发布 "
"`/fsm_command`。FSM 切换和遥操作开关由 `VRInputHandler` 处理。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:43
#: 0ecd6b2421de488bb7d92f08e99fa4d3
msgid "With exactly one supported pedal connected:"
msgstr "在恰好接入一块受支持的脚踏板时："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:45
#: 985b0e06aab547f9ad8e39407ea01f3f
msgid "ros2 run arms_teleop foot_pedal_teleop"
msgstr "ros2 run arms_teleop foot_pedal_teleop"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:49
#: 829d869c609e412bae4d8f655e7aa985
msgid ""
"The package README documents the event map (FSM up/down, left/right arm "
"teleop enable, STORAGE/UPDATE, mirror), udev setup, and how to choose a "
"device when more than one pedal is connected."
msgstr ""
"软件包 README 记录了事件映射（FSM 上/下、左/右臂遥操作使能、STORAGE/UPDATE、镜像）、udev "
"配置，以及接入多块脚踏板时如何选择设备。"

